Package: PhyloCactus
Type: Package
Title: Phylogenetic Inference, Divergence Time Estimation and Molecular Identification for Cactaceae
Version: 0.5.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Beatriz M.", "Meriño", email = "b.vergara.m@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9518-2331")),
    person("Tania", "Hernández-Hernández", role = "ctb"),
    person("M.", "Pillet", role = "ctb"),
    person("Pablo C.", "Guerrero", email = "pabloguerrero@udec.cl", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Provides a reproducible workflow for reconstructing Cactaceae phylogenies from multilocus DNA sequence data and for identifying samples of cacti by DNA barcoding. The phylogeny branch automates GenBank sequence retrieval, multiple-sequence alignment, substitution model selection, saturation assessment, supermatrix construction, maximum-likelihood phylogenetic inference using RAxML-NG, divergence time estimation with treePL, and comparison with published phylogenies in tree space. The identification branch builds a reference library of marker sequences from the same mining, validates it with cross-validation folds and negative controls, and identifies a sample locus by locus from sequences, an assembly or sequencing reads, with a self-contained report.
URL: https://github.com/beeamerino/PhyloCactus, https://beeamerino.github.io/PhyloCactus/
BugReports: https://github.com/beeamerino/PhyloCactus/issues
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
